{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_1000_place", "source_sha256": "6eca5bbb1fa78d35aa198d3e81e0dba68b9083054421ede6d539e7ce9a5b7d45", "ja": "オーディション会場", "zh": "试镜会场", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_1001_p", "source_sha256": "7705be8121b5ecd4901e25a57f2098b49e658ef5a98ee189bd85db6ab3325912", "ja": "お疲れさま、紗代子。そろそろ\nオーディションが始まるけど、緊張してないか？", "zh": "辛苦了，纱代子。\n试镜就快开始了，会紧张吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_1002_027say", "source_sha256": "65f6d32ecc83bd73a57afed7343b74c76c78744271aa57fb92f4b39207bba9e4", "ja": "{$P$}、そのことなんですけど……\n台本はしっかり読み込んで、セリフは覚えてきました。", "zh": "{$P$}，关于这个……\n我已经熟读剧本，也记住台词了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_1003_027say", "source_sha256": "b55c42879dc5084fecf7c3c98d4b397a92c5a8ae1aa662139bcab7622274c9a5", "ja": "でも、演技にはまだあまり自信がなくて。\nどうしたらいいか、相談に乗ってもらえますか？", "zh": "但是，对自己的演技还没什么自信。\n我可以跟你商量该怎么做才好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_1004_p", "source_sha256": "2e392dd1a576b59673a687cf09b2e9579b4cdf80d824deb8c9b169253408f3af", "ja": "もちろん！　狙っているのは、キャプテン役だったな？\nなら、部をまとめる包容力を感じさせるといいかもな。", "zh": "当然可以！你要试镜的是队长的角色吧？\n那么，表现出能整合社团的包容力会比较好吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_1005_027say", "source_sha256": "976d6e9d2580060ba8ecdfb0219332dfaebb5c52821ef335424c34522b8c2dd0", "ja": "包容力ですか？　なるほど……スポ根ものとはいえ、\n厳しいだけじゃ部員はついてこない、ってことですね！", "zh": "包容力吗？原来如此……虽然是热血体育的故事，\n但是光会严格教导是不会有社员愿意跟随的，对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_1006_027say", "source_sha256": "c16072b48caf000b8cc2e613fa072d8b665729dc1af1f22c77878c10e00d795e", "ja": "{$P$}、ありがとうございます！\n私、包容力のあるキャプテンを演じてみせます！", "zh": "{$P$}，谢谢你！\n我会试着演出有包容力的队长！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
